<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第五幕 · 怎么判断</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>第三句：值不值得换，看边界有没有挡住真实交付</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 400, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>挡住</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 8}}>认真评估要不要换</Text><Box style={{height: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.14)", marginTop: 16, marginBottom: 16}}></Box><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>没挡住</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 8}}>先用好手上的</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 728, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>运行边界开始限制真实交付了吗？</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", marginTop: 14}}>判据不是「装了多少工具」。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>接得上第三幕：那儿问「改得动几项」，这儿问「改不动的部分有没有真的挡路」。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 16}}>本场不替你们选哪条路线——选型的输入是你们自己的边界。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>41 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
